# The Pages job publishes `path: .`, so anything committed here is served
# publicly. Byte-compiled scripts were, for months.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated by scripts/build_index.py at deploy time, one directory per app.
# Not committed: the workflow deploys the tree it builds, so a copy in here
# could only ever be a stale one.
/app/

# Generated too: the download history behind /stats.html, read back from the live
# site on every run. A committed copy would only ever be stale.
/history-v1.json
